["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Fei Fei Li: The Race to Build World Models For AI new view prediction Gaussian splat NeRF AI complete spatial intelligence\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-a16z-世界模型的新基元-不是预测下一帧-而是预测下一个视角/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">44:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>世界模型的新基元：不是预测下一帧，而是预测下一个视角</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">语言模型靠预测下一个 token，Atlas 靠预测下一个视角。它把生成和重建放进同一个模型，用三台 iPhone 复现《黑客帝国》几百台摄像机才拍出的子弹时间。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">空间智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Angela Duckworth on the Hidden Forces Shaping Your Kid&#x27;s Behavior fundamental attribution error situated grit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-raisinggh-想养出有毅力的孩子-先改环境而不是靠意志力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/57108a4c3704d4ba-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">48:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>想养出有毅力的孩子，先改环境而不是靠意志力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人的行为大部分是反应式的：盘子大就吃得多，手机在手边就会拿起来。情境像重力一样拉着你，所以该做的是选哪些重力来拉自己，而不是硬扛。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">行为设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Why Laser Beams Are the Hottest New Tech in Defense Directed Energy Weapons (DEW) High-Powered Microwave (HPM) SWaP Exquisite munition Shore power\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-oddlots-激光武器终于要实战了-美军已花-150-亿研发/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">53:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>激光武器终于要实战了：美军已花 150 亿研发</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">激光被称为定向能武器里的狙击步枪，微波则是电子霰弹枪。美军正在从研发转向采购，但真正短缺的是廉价拦截器——能不能赢每一场交战却打不起，才是关键。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">定向能武器</span><span class=\"tag\">激光</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Emperor Constantine the Great: Christianity and the Roman Empire Tetrarchy cursus publicus Nicene Creed Donation of Constantine Arian heresy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-youdead-君士坦丁受洗在死床上-尼西亚信经是妥协产物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c8f3a3170c71964d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">59:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">You&#x27;re Dead to Me</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>君士坦丁受洗在死床上，尼西亚信经是妥协产物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他死前才受洗，由阿里乌派主教主持；尼西亚信经是父子同质的妥协，不是他的信仰宣言。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗马史</span><span class=\"tag\">基督教</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Evel Knievel Faces the Abyss Positive Mental Attitude Manifesting Control Optimists X2 Skycycle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-cautionary-相信能成-所以从不准备-特技车王差点死在4000英尺峡谷/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">40:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>相信能成，所以从不准备：特技车王差点死在4000英尺峡谷</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特技车王 Knievel 把「正面心态」当方法论：跳前不练车、不算角度、不测风险。心理学教授 Oettingen 的实验表明，乐观幻想不会助推成功，反而让人瘫痪——Snake River 的失败在点火前就已注定。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">积极心态</span><span class=\"tag\">成功学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Monologue: Concentration Risk concentration risk take-or-pay agreement neocloud revenue backlog\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-betteroffline-ai-巨头-80-企业收入来自-1-客户-多数靠-vc-续命/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fd2855e350ec8287-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">10:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Better Offline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>AI 巨头 80% 企业收入来自 1% 客户，多数靠 VC 续命</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 与 Anthropic 的企业收入 80% 来自 1% 的客户，且多是靠 VC 补贴烧 token 的 AI 公司；肯付大钱的只有科技圈自己，VC 一断，上万亿算力账单率先爆。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">集中度风险</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 泡沫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"AI EDAs: Is It Real? EDA RTL PDK PPA tapeout\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-asianometry-ai-设计芯片是真的-验证仍是头号瓶颈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d3ecab66be5c5d83-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>AI 设计芯片是真的，验证仍是头号瓶颈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 已经能自主写出 RTL，但整条芯片流水线真正的卡点是验证：它吃掉一半以上开发时间，AI 却回答不了「该测什么」。OpenAI 二十人团队能缩短前段，后端仍要留给人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 芯片设计</span><span class=\"tag\">EDA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Pablo Torre Explains the Steve Ballmer &amp; Kawhi Leonard Scandal salary cap jersey patch sponsor SPAC carbon credits\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-tbpn-微软前ceo绕开nba工资帽的败笔-球星白拿4800万不干活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c1929723d7b47586-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">23:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">TBPN</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>微软前CEO绕开NBA工资帽的败笔：球星白拿4800万不干活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正让 Steve Ballmer 翻不了身的，不是向 Kawhi 输送的 4800 万美元，而是这些钱没有对应任何真实交付物——「白拿钱不干活」的条文让所谓代言在调查中彻底崩解。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">NBA</span><span class=\"tag\">工资帽</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Bearish Into November. Room to Run After: Why Dan Niles Is Watching Hyperscaler Credit Default Swaps Credit Default Swap (CDS) Hyperscaler Token Agentic AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-excessreturns-ai泡沫何时破-紧盯信用违约互换与token价格/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>AI泡沫何时破？紧盯信用违约互换与token价格</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI泡沫终将破裂，但当前估值远低于互联网泡沫时期，Nvidia市盈率仅15倍。真正的风险在于信贷市场，信用违约互换已升至历史高位，预示未来可能的大幅回调。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">半导体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"AI Detection with Max Spero synthetic mirroring humanizer classifier head WildChat\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-oxide-ai-检测不是查文风-是查信息有没有注水/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3e86858ac01c0a5f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Oxide and Friends</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>AI 检测不是查文风，是查信息有没有注水</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 写作的破绽不是文风，而是输出比输入多出来的「信息注水」。对冲基金大佬的 AI 社论公开认账成了拐点——Pangram 四代误报率约 2.4 万分之一，且模型越收敛反而越好抓。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 检测</span><span class=\"tag\">内容真伪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"From 10 Drones a Month to Nearly 100,000 — Inside Ukraine&#x27;s Largest Drone Manufacturer | Marko Kushnir, General Cherry Shahed FPV Interceptor drone Moniya\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-eyeonai-乌克兰最大无人机商-月产近10万架-ai拦截是第一步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6080df200909c386-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">38:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Eye On A.I.</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>乌克兰最大无人机商：月产近10万架，AI拦截是第一步</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">乌克兰无人机厂商 General Cherry 月产近10万架，其中拦截无人机以约2000美元成本击落5万美元以上的俄方 Shahed，AI 制导已实战，但全自主仍遥远。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">无人机</span><span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Wow! Signal: Alien Message, Cosmic Fluke, or SETI’s Best False Alarm? transit telescope hydrogen line water hole maser side lobe technosignature\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-isaacarthur-wow信号近50年没落定-它像外星呼叫-却再没来第二声/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5655ebd36cb58413-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">35:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">IsaacArthur</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>WOW信号近50年没落定：它像外星呼叫，却再没来第二声</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1977年那段72秒的窄带氢线信号从未复现，够不到外星文明证据的门槛；它的遗产不是答案，而是提醒我们：在噪声宇宙里，发现与证明之间隔着整条银河。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">射电天文</span><span class=\"tag\">SETI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Can a land value tax fix housing? | Lars Doucet Land Value Tax (LVT) Georgism YIMBY Mass Appraisal Single Tax Natural Dividend\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-moneymacro-土地不是商品-地价税为何能根治住房危机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/125e287967146306-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">MoneyMacro</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>土地不是商品：地价税为何能根治住房危机</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">住房短缺只是表象，真正的病灶是土地垄断：地价税把税负从建筑转移到土地，逼着囤地者开发或卖地，让地段价值回归社会，而不是养肥地主。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地价税</span><span class=\"tag\">住房危机</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Paul Graham On Startups, Ambition, and Great Founders formidable frighteningly ambitious jagged frontier founder mode YC GDP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-ycsp-驱动创始人的不是当亿万富翁-是怕服务器半夜崩掉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/516c0e86f9dca57d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">21:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>驱动创始人的不是当亿万富翁，是怕服务器半夜崩掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多数人以为撑过创业的是财富野心。Paul Graham 说日常真正推着人走的是灾难恐惧——服务器崩了、模型火车快掉下桌子；埋头十年抬头一算，才发现按上一轮估值自己已经是亿万富翁。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创业方法论</span><span class=\"tag\">创始人特质</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The $100B Niches Hiding Inside Payments MDR APR deferred interest B2B2C secure enclave factoring\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-a16z-支付里没有小于千亿美元的小众市场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>支付里没有小于千亿美元的小众市场</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">支付是全世界最大的市场，任何你以为最窄的切口一算都是千亿美元；但金额越大抽成越小，真正赚钱的是小额高频。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">支付</span><span class=\"tag\">消费信贷</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Redefining Chip Architecture with Arm CEO Rene Haas IP licensing compute subsystem RTL GDSII\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-nopriors-arm-下场造-cpu-芯片设计最大瓶颈是验证-不是设计/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e36b80375fbfde6c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">37:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>Arm 下场造 CPU：芯片设计最大瓶颈是验证，不是设计</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">芯片周期真正的耗时大头是验证、调试和文档，不是 RTL；Arm 已有 80%-90% 工程师每天用 AI，并打破 98.5% 毛利的授权模式亲身下场造 CPU。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Arm</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Ethics Problem in Financial Services (Dr. Moira Somers &amp; Philippa Hann) | Rational Reminder 425 ACFE CFP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-rationalreminder-金融舞弊头号预警-不是贪婪-是个人财务先失控/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2de1b986a9bfa34c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:40:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>金融舞弊头号预警：不是贪婪，是个人财务先失控</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ACFE 连续 14 年把「个人财务问题」列为财务违规的第一预警信号；系统激励、批判脑区下线与道德高估，都会让好人一步步越界。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">金融伦理</span><span class=\"tag\">财务顾问</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"How the Planet-Altering Disaster of “Forever Chemicals” Was Kept Secret PFAS PFOS Scotchgard forever chemicals\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-papertrail-3m-早就知道-却让一位科学家以为自己错了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88c11f238ad040c0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">44:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>3M 早就知道，却让一位科学家以为自己错了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">3M 在 1970 年代就知道 PFOS 已进入普通人血液，却让发现它的年轻科学家被反复质疑到放弃。秘密不是靠销毁文件保住的，是靠让知情者自己闭嘴。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">调查报道</span><span class=\"tag\">PFAS</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"What&#x27;s Behind the Big Surge in US Government Bond Yields term premium fiscal dominance off-the-run Treasuries ratchet effect Treasury General Account (TGA)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-oddlots-美债利率上-5-不是通胀闹的-32-万亿国债让买家只肯加价接盘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">36:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>美债利率上 5% 不是通胀闹的：32 万亿国债让买家只肯加价接盘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">通胀解释不了 30 年期破 5%：即便无通胀无违约风险，已在 5.3% 配满美债的买方也不会为新增 100 亿动心。真正推高曲线的是每年再增 2 万亿的国债供给，财政部想靠回购压也压不住。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美债收益率</span><span class=\"tag\">国债回购</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Everyone wants to be your wallet ACH interchange Durbin-exempt institution bps / bips\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-complexsys-钱包的利润密码不是余额利息-是钱在体系内流转/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/939355004e704d04-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">33:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>钱包的利润密码不是余额利息，是钱在体系内流转</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">钱包的核心账：转进来要付卡组织通道费，体系内互转近乎免费，出金还能再收；它赚的是流动价差而不是沉淀利息，PayPal、Cash App、Stripe Link 都在赌这个模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">支付</span><span class=\"tag\">钱包</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"I’ll Believe in AGI When It Solves Quantum Gravity | Prof. Rajesh Gopakumar | Theoretical Physicist Quantum gravity String theory Bose-Einstein condensation Synthesizability\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-spc-解不出量子引力-就不算真正的-agi/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/00b7c1ae9f5f7539-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">South Park Commons</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>解不出量子引力，就不算真正的 AGI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">物理学家给 AGI 划了一条高线：解出量子引力才算数。这场对话还讲清量子材料与 AI 的真实关系——搜索到的材料要过了可合成一关，结果可能剩零个。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">弦理论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"507 – Law and Order: Normandy chivalry Magna Carta vicomte\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-britishhist-亨利一世不杀弟弟-却发明了国王随意关人的先例/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">32:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>亨利一世不杀弟弟，却发明了国王随意关人的先例</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">亨利一世把亲弟弟和表弟无限期关进宫殿，没罪名、没审判。他破了骑士规则，也埋下了《大宪章》里两条禁止国王随意抓人的条款。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世纪</span><span class=\"tag\">诺曼底</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"153. 和曾鸣聊产业史观：残酷的真相、会消亡的公司、优秀≠卓越、“OAI、Anth大概率不是原生时代大赢家” Token factory Agentic OS New Lab High agency Context not control\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-zhangxiaojun-ai没有安全巨头-公司制度将消亡/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2be28ff846f98de7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:34:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珲·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>AI 领跑者只是炼油厂，不是原生应用大赢家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI进入智能体阶段：第一阶段领跑者只是炼油厂，不是原生应用大赢家；新平台不来自旧平台，组织要从岗位转向任务，最后人拼的是无中生有的创造力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI产业</span><span class=\"tag\">战略方法论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Why Investors Say &quot;We Don&#x27;t Back Solo Founders&quot; (And What They Mean) co-founder of convenience denominator delusion true solo talent bar\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-solofounders-投资人说不投单人创始人-多半只是个体面的拒绝/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac921ee36ff71005-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">21:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>投资人说不投单人创始人，多半只是个体面的拒绝</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">65% 的创业公司死于人的问题，而早期公司里「人」就是联合创始人——所以不投单人创始人这个理由，往往只是投资人不想说真话时最省事的出口。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创业</span><span class=\"tag\">融资</span>\n</div></div></a>"]